-- The procs that hang off combat styles.
--
-- Part 4, and the last of the sweep. StyleID here is style.ID -- the relation
-- reads [Relation(LocalField = "ID", RemoteField = "StyleID")] -- and not the
-- style table's own primary key, so the renumbering done when the styles were
-- imported does not reach these either. Same rule as the spell lines: both
-- ends have to exist before the row is worth having.

